// Kestrel Sedan body: the early-90s aero family sedan.
//
// Intent: soft but not yet oval. A low, smooth nose with a full-width light bar (slim
// flush lamps either side of a lit slot, no grille above the bumper), a sloped hood, a
// raked windshield, a rounded roof with six side windows (a small one in each rear
// pillar), a short soft deck and wide tail lamps. Body-colored bumpers with a dark rub
// strip, black window frames, plain alloys for the better trims. Generic period cues only.
//
// Units are meters; x runs rearward from the nose, y up from the ground. Layout:
// docs/VEHICLES.md and crates/vehicle/src/shape/params.rs.
